@startuml state-machine
title Planning node - avoidance state machine

[*] --> DISARMED : boot

DISARMED : nothing published on /cmd_vel
CRUISE : forward at cruise_speed
STOP : zero command
REVERSE : backing away
TURN : turning on the spot
FAULT : zero command

DISARMED --> CRUISE : /arm true
CRUISE --> STOP : range < stop_distance_cm
STOP --> REVERSE : stopped
REVERSE --> TURN : reversed
TURN --> CRUISE : after turn_duration_s

CRUISE --> FAULT : range invalid or\nolder than range_stale_ms
STOP --> FAULT : range invalid or stale
REVERSE --> FAULT : range invalid or stale
TURN --> FAULT : range invalid or stale

CRUISE --> DISARMED : /arm false
STOP --> DISARMED : /arm false
REVERSE --> DISARMED : /arm false
TURN --> DISARMED : /arm false
FAULT --> DISARMED : /arm false

@enduml
